<div class="mk-crumbbar"><div class="mk-wrap in"><a href="#">Markets</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><a href="/markets/rfid">RFID</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><span class="here">RFID Tire Tags</span></div></div><div class="mk-spoke-grid"><aside class="mk-side"><div class="side-head"><span class="side-head-label">RFID products</span><button type="button" class="mk-side-toggle" aria-label="Collapse sidebar"><span class="chev"><i data-lucide="chevron-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></span></button></div><a class="s" href="/markets/rfid/rfid-cards"><span class="abbr">RC</span><span class="label">RFID Smart Cards</span></a><a class="s" href="/markets/rfid/rfid-tags-inlays"><span class="abbr">TI</span><span class="label">RFID Tags &amp; Inlays</span></a><a class="s active" href="/markets/rfid/rfid-tire-tags"><span class="abbr">TT</span><span class="label">RFID Tire Tags</span></a><div class="helper"><div class="h">Not sure which fits?</div><p>Tell us what has to be read, and where, and we&rsquo;ll point you to the right line.</p><a class="cta" href="/contact">Work with us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></aside><div class="mk-spoke-main"><section class="mk-hero" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap mk-hero-in"><div><div class="mk-eyebrow">RFID &middot; RFID Tire Tags</div><h1 class="mk-h1">RFID tire tags</h1><p class="mk-lede">Hana manufactures rubber-embeddable UHF tire tags using inlay and strap constructions encapsulated in materials selected for integration into the tire and exposure to the curing process. The same automated RFID manufacturing capability also supports card, logistics and industrial-tag formats.</p><div class="mk-btns"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-primary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Talk to us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a><a href="#specialize-rfid-tire-tags" class="hana-btn hana-btn-secondary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">What we specialize in</a></div></div><div class="mk-hero-media"><div class="mk-ph" style="aspect-ratio:auto;height:420px;border-bottom:0;"><div style="position:absolute;top:10px;left:12px;width:18px;height:18px;opacity:.4;z-index:1;"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--hana-blue)" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4"></path></svg></div><span class="cap">[ RFID Tire Tags &mdash; photography needed ]</span></div></div></div></section><section id="specialize-rfid-tire-tags" data-hana-bg="hex" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:var(--bg);border-top:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:26px;"><h2 class="mk-h2">What we specialize in</h2><p class="mk-body">Detailed tire-tag construction and application information is covered in the Automotive market section; this page places the product within Hana's wider RFID manufacturing range.</p></div><div class="mk-sheet"><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">01</span><span class="t">Rubber-embeddable UHF tags</span></div><div class="desc">UHF inlay and strap constructions encapsulated in rubber-compatible materials for integration into the tire.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">02</span><span class="t">Automated production</span></div><div class="desc">Manufactured using Hana's automated roll-to-roll RFID processes.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">03</span><span class="t">Post-cure verification and unique ID</span></div><div class="desc">Read-performance verification after cure, with unique identification available for each tag.</div></div></div><div class="mk-caplinks"><p class="note">See RFID Tire Tags for the antenna, material and cure-survival processes specific to tire-tag manufacturing.</p><div class="links"><a href="/capabilities/rfid-smart-tags/rfid-tire-tags">Explore RFID Tire Tags <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></div></div></section><section class="mk-dark"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div style="max-width:820px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark">Where the detail lives</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="margin:0 0 14px;">Detailed tire-tag construction, material and validation information is covered in the <a href="/markets/automotive/rfid-tire-tags">Automotive tire-tag page</a>. Within the wider RFID portfolio, tire tags sit alongside smart cards, UHF and HF inlays, on-metal tags and temperature-sensing products.</p></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--hana-blue-tint);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:56px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:24px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">Footprint</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Where we build</h2></div><div class="mk-locs"><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/jiaxing"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">China</span></span><div class="nm">Jiaxing</div><div class="note">automated RFID inlay lines</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/ohio"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">USA</span></span><div class="nm">Ohio</div><div class="note">inlays, straps and tire tags</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a></div><p style="margin:18px 0 0;"><a href="/locations" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;">All locations <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></a></p></div></section><section style="background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:22px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">FAQ</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Frequently asked questions</h2></div><div style="max-width:860px;"><details class="mk-faq" open><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">How is a tire tag built to take being embedded in a tire?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Tire tags use rubber-compatible materials and encapsulation selected for integration into the tire and exposure to the curing process. Read performance can be verified after cure as part of the manufacturing flow. The <a href="/markets/automotive/rfid-tire-tags">Automotive page</a> covers the construction in more detail.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">How does tire-tag manufacturing relate to Hana's wider RFID capability?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Tire tags use the same core inlay, strap-attach and roll-to-roll manufacturing capability as Hana's wider RFID portfolio, with additional material and process requirements for embedding and cure.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Where does Hana build tire tags?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Tire-tag manufacturing capability is available across Hana's RFID operations in China and the USA, with the applicable site confirmed per program.</p></details></div><div style="margin-top:40px;padding-top:26px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><a href="/markets/rfid" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;"><i data-lucide="arrow-left" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i> Back to the RFID market hub</a></div></div></section><section class="mk-cta" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark" style="max-width:520px;">Talk to us about your tire-tag program</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="font-size:16px;max-width:480px;">Tell us what you need built and we will come back with a plan.</p></div><div class="acts"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-on-dark" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a></div></div></section></div></div>